# Keep LF in the working copy on every platform.
#
# Generated figures must round-trip byte-identically: the build scripts write
# LF, so a CRLF checkout would make every rebuild look like a whole-file diff
# and destroy the "a diff in output/ means a diff in source/" guarantee.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
